:Y-MAX 34
:DATASET mc1
:LINE-COLOR 0-255-0
:LINE-WIDTH 3
:VAR CL TempOutputCalc[tmax,Industrial commercial public military and private units]|BAU
:DATASET mc0
:LINE-COLOR 255-0-0
:LINE-WIDTH 3
